time": "400"}, {"image": "frn1le01ob01re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-100\">Anne</span> : Bonjour, Kenji. Comment \u00e7a va ? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Kenji</span> : Bonjour, Anne. \u00c7a va tr\u00e8s bien. C'est vendredi aujourd'hui. Je suis tr\u00e8s content.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Anne</span> : Moi aussi. J'aime bien le week-end. Au revoir, Kenji.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Kenji</span> : \u00c0 lundi, Anne.", "id": 2, "time": "17500"}, {"image": "frn1le01ob01re2img03.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-100\">Martin</span> : Salut, Jeanne. \u00c7a va ?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Jeanne</span> : Salut, Martin. \u00c7a va. Et toi ?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Martin</span> : Moi aussi. On regarde un film ce soir ?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Jeanne</span> : D'accord. \u00c0 plus tard alors.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Martin</span> : \u00c0 plus tard.", "id": 3, "time": "34000"}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Je peux me pr\u00e9senter.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux \u00e9changer de l'information personnelle simple.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux saluer des amis et des coll\u00e8gues.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Comment saluez-vous vos amis&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Comment saluez-vous votre professeur&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Je peux parler de ma saison pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9e.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you hav